#: tretlager/kde/qml/AboutPage.qml:33
msgid ""
"Set up Zwift on Linux, keep it up to date and connect it to your trainer and "
"heart rate strap.\n"
"Tretlager is a private project and not a program by Zwift Inc. Zwift does "
"not support running on Linux. Use at your own risk."
