#: tretlager/kde/qml/AboutPage.qml:79
msgid ""
"Zwift does not support Linux or Wine. Report problems to Tretlager, not to "
"Zwift."
msgstr ""
"Zwift unterstützt Linux und Wine nicht. Probleme an Tretlager melden, nicht "
