#~ msgid "At your own risk"
#~ msgstr "Auf eigene Gefahr"

#~ msgid "Not for races"
#~ msgstr "Nicht für Rennen"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no guarantee that the sensor bridge passes power, cadence and "
#~ "heart rate to Zwift completely and correctly; transmission errors and "
#~ "dropouts are possible. Do not use Tretlager for races or competitions "
#~ "with results."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Es gibt keine Garantie, dass die Sensor-Bridge Leistung, Trittfrequenz "
